<title>USA: Escambia Cty Housing Authority, Fla., repriced.</title>
<headline>Escambia Cty Housing Authority, Fla., repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R Hough &amp; Co said Thursday it repriced Escambia County Housing Authority, Fla.'s $53.2 million bond deal. The top yield was 6.10 percent in 2030.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
